    "long_instructions": "##Hospital Triage Data\r\n\r\nExamine the hospital triage forms below for the six patients that arrived at the same time. \r\n\r\nUse your best judgement and rank the order in which these patients should be seen. Drag the numbers in the box to the left and place them at the top of the chart to indicate the order.\r\n\r\nFor the patient who should be seen first, write a justification as to why you chose them,\r\n\r\n\r\n",
